editor_description = "[필수] 지우면 오류 — RunResultScreen.gd _apply_safe_area() · RunResultScreen.gd _fill()
Ends 16 above the bottom bar; code also lifts offset_bottom by the device's bottom inset. offset_right = scroll bar width with the bar space always reserved: the bar sits just off screen, so the body is always the full screen width (cards stay centred) — like the old code-built body."
